From: Lionel Debieve <lionel.debieve@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Nov 2021 15:49:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0630/1695] drivers: update counter framework to manage
 configuration

Add new interfaces to manage counter dynamic configuration.
It allows to change the counter input defined by the caller.
Aligned the lptimer driver accordingly.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 2a45e255899d839aae91cd64258d1ffd8eda3799 drivers: update counter framework to manage configuration]
